<details class="tm-cm-help"><summary>Auto-Postpone Documentation</summary>

Auto-postpone automatically defers lower-priority overdue cards daily (at startup and every hour) while preserving high-priority cards. Configure via <code>$:/config/Tidme/AutoPostpone</code>: <code>{"enable": true, "maxPriority": 60, "postponeDays": 7, "keepTop": 10}</code>.

</details>

Subset Review: The "Review Book" button on document pages creates a temporary subset deck for that book's cards, which is automatically cleaned up after review.
